From 213fb386629c443fc3c4d8e0a8167daea34d54eb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 14:12:29 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD terminal visual selection yanks so users can copy
 either pane

The terminal UI treats the focused pane as selectable rendered text and routes visual-mode movement, line/block selection, and yanks through the shared terminal state machine. Copy output is queued through OSC52 so wrapped transcript rows and left-pane rows can be copied without leaving Work Leaf.
