index 9e48703..0433ac7 100644
--- a/docs/architecture.md
+++ b/docs/architecture.md
@@ -305,6 +305,13 @@ again.
   terminal navigation actions. The right pane keeps the chat prompt visible while scroll offsets
   reveal earlier transcript rows.
 
+In command mode, `TerminalUi` supports vim-style visual selection in the focused pane. `v`, `V`, and
+Ctrl-V start character, line, and block selection; h/j/k/l and arrow keys move the visual cursor; `y`
+copies the selection; and `Y` copies complete rendered lines. Left-pane selections copy the rendered
+agent/control rows, while right-pane selections copy the visible wrapped transcript text. The
+terminal adapters call `TerminalUi::take_pending_copy` after handling UI actions so copied text is
+queued for OSC52 clipboard output and the selection is cleared.
+
 `src/ui_harness.rs::UiHarness` is the test harness for terminal behavior. It exercises the same
 `TerminalUi` frame path used by the interactive example. UI tests should drive
 `UiHarness::handle_byte` or `UiHarness::handle_bytes` rather than duplicating terminal input logic.
